message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "幻元 (Huanyuan): Token-Native Factorized Representation for Interpretable Generalization"
abstract: >-
  Systematic generalization as the formalization of induction: a minimal transformer
  (~2 layers, <1 MB) generalizes to arbitrary width/radix/order with ~2000-6000 samples
  and config-dependent epochs (3-8), via definition completeness and relational
  training sufficiency. Includes symbol-permutation invariance (0.987), three-channel
  semantic equivalence (1.000 on 2000-digit carry chains), and step-skipping
  generalization (zero decay to 2000 digits / radix 60 / 100% anonymization).
  See the release integrity manifest for SHA256 of locked assets.
